icial journey  because sure netro is now dead however  lynnea is still alive and well so it  should be at least two survivors if they  were factored in so luckily for zigg  this gives him a lot of potential to you  know not be dead to complicate matters  though this is another thing that often  gets overlooked but natara actually set  foot on the dark continent twice  according to him one of these occasions  is the unofficial voyage that we are  exploring in this video but the other is  completely unknown it's almost certainly  another sneaky unofficial trip because  the voyagers with survivors that we know  of were all conducted by the v5 nations  who did so without informing the hunter  association very sneaky of them but  meaning that netaro likely would have  had no involvement with them but the  most interesting thing steiner says is  that mankind has never succeeded at  making a round trip but then he has this  brief inner thought where he thinks to  himself not officially implying that he  may have knowledge of some unofficial  journeys or just showing us that steiner  has a healthy dose of skepticism about  him realizing all of the potential  faults in officially collated knowledge  and one question that steiner may have  failed to ask at this point is where did  their dark continent knowledge come from  who published journey to the new world  because it was written by don frixius  but it was clearly not published or  distributed by him so that leaves us  with a mystery publisher which leads us  quite nicely now into jing freaks jing  is a unique man for about a billion  different reasons however on this  occasion he possesses some pretty insane  knowledge in fact it's only because of  jing that we even know about netro's  voyage to begin with jing dropped that  massive nugget when he was explaining  the dangers of the dark continent to  beyond's expedition team and this is  pretty huge because you need to ask why  jing and you can't say that sure he knew  b